### Habits that help
- Read the level goal and the "commands you may need" list before typing anything.
- Use `man <command>` or `<command> --help` before asking for help.
- Filenames starting with `-` or containing spaces need `./` or quotes.
- Keep a running list of every command that worked. It feeds the cheat-sheet below.

